  "PLAIN RECALL AT k=10: THE 8B FINDS MORE. high-8b 34/38 (single-hop 15/16, multi-hop 19/22), MRR 0.596, against the 4B's 31/38, 0.592 and lean's 33/38, 0.569. It is the only embedder that beats lean with no reranker.",
